The following uses and activities shall be exempt from the noise regulations set forth in this chapter: i Noises of safety signals and warning devices;

- 2. Noises resulting from any authorized emergency vehicle, when responding to an emergency call acting in time of emergency; and

- 3. Noises resulting from emergency work, to be construed as work made necessary to restore property to a safe condition following a public calamity, or work required to protect persons or property from an imminent exposure to danger.
